  "body": "We (@otherdaniel and I) want to help with and ensure well-specified interactions between the Sanitizer API and HTML.\r\nSpecifically, we were thinking of this split:\r\n\r\nSanitizer API\r\n- Sanitizer interface, constructor and properties\r\n- algorithm for sanitizing a document fragment\r\n\r\nHTML\r\n- default list of elements that one can safely use without causing XSS (while being explicit about the caveats listed in https://wicg.github.io/sanitizer-api/#security-considerations)\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if there are any questions and we're obviously happy to take feedback.",
